{{!
    @template core/login_panel

    Image panel of the login page (overridden by theme_synergylearning).

    The panel shows the MyLearning banner (set in lib.php), which already carries the site name and tagline,
    so Moodle's default welcome copy and statistics are left out. Custom instructions entered by an admin
    (Site administration > Plugins > Authentication > Manage authentication > Instructions) still show.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "leftinstructions": "<p>Welcome to our learning platform. Please log in to continue.</p>"
    }
}}
{{#leftinstructions}}
    <div class="login-layout-left-content">
        <div class="mx-auto text-start">
            {{{leftinstructions}}}
        </div>
    </div>
{{/leftinstructions}}
